发生了异变。", "0", "0", "0", "0", "0"},
[100211] = {id = 100211, scroll = 100020, type = 2, teacheid = 0, name = "5-12", cname = "The\u{0020}Weak\u{0020}One", plot_first = "2_5", plot_last = "0", map = "0", bgm = "20-Battle-Warehouse2_MP3", unlock = "0_1", front = "100210", open = "100212_100020", player = "0", monster = "0", consume = "4_100001_0", frequency = 0, condition = "0", reward = "1_100000_10,1_100001_2000", drop = "0", victory = "0", roleexp = "0", failure = "0", introduction = "This\u{0020}is\u{0020}the\u{0020}story\u{0020}of\u{0020}the\u{0020}Third\u{0020}Laboratory's\u{0020}defense\u{0020}team,\u{0020}Dolores's\u{0020}temporarily\u{0020}lost\u{0020}memories.\u{0020}It's\u{0020}okay,\u{0020}even\u{0020}if\u{0020}forgotten\u{0020}for\u{0020}a\u{0020}while,\u{0020}memories\u{0020}will\u{0020}catch\u{0020}up\u{0020}with\u{0020}you\u{0020}soon.\u{0020}This\u{0020}is\u{0020}Dolores's\u{0020}happiest\u{0020}time.", prohibit = "0", scrollmappos = "0", prohibitskill = "0", picture = "dialog_2-5", npctype = 0, npcbanmove = "0", playnumber = 9, recomlevel = 0, bgpicture = "dialog_2-5", reserve = "0", dangerousenemy = "0_0", npcheads = "0", promptdialog = "0", returnfloorid = 0, continuouscombattype = 0, activitypreview2 = "0", energycondition = "0", timelocal = "0", itembonus = "0", "弱小的她", "0", "\u{0020}\u{0020}这是第三研究院防卫队的故事，是多洛莉丝暂时遗落掉的记忆，没关系，就算暂时遗忘，记忆也会马上追上你的，这是多洛莉丝，最幸福的时光。", "0", "0", "0", "0", "0"},
